===Noun===
{{en-noun|horseflies}}

# Any of several medium- to large [[flies]], of the [[family]] ''[[Wikipedia:Tabanidae|Tabanidae]]'', that suck the [[blood]] of [[mammal]]s (not to be confused with Stomoxys calcitrans, the [[stable fly]], or [[Wikipedia:stable fly|dog fly]]).

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|fly of family ''Tabanidae''}} [[cleg]], [[Wikipedia:Deer fly|deer fly]], [[Wikipedia:Deer fly|forest fly]], [[gadfly]], [[Wikipedia:Deer fly|March fly]] {{italbrac|Australia}}, [[Wikipedia:Deer fly|yellow fly]], [[zimb]]
 

